{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o045b","title":"立曹芳齐王曹询秦王","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o045b-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"立曹芳齐王曹询秦王","evidence":["mingdi-e-o045b-q"]},{"id":"shaodi-e-o002a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"青龙三年：曹芳立为齐王","evidence":["shaodi-e-o002a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0129","role":"受封","evidence":["mingdi-e-o045b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0042","role":"受封","evidence":["mingdi-e-o045b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":235,"label":"八月庚午","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y235","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o043","basis":"八月庚午"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o045b-q","mingdi-q-o043","mingdi-q-b-e98ed256e58910694910"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o045b-q","source_order":[3,295,"O045b"],"order":880}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0042","name":"曹询","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0129","name":"曹芳","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o045b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e0cb069529888c40aeca","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，洛阳崇华殿灾。八月，庚午〖11〗，立皇子芳为齐王〖12〗，询为秦王。丁巳〖13〗，行还洛阳宫。命有司复崇华〖14〗；改名“九龙殿”。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e98ed256e58910694910","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e98ed256e58910694910","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：青龙三年（公元 235）。明帝将司马懿提升为太尉，使他让出大将军一职，出自深层次政治考量。太尉作为三公之首，品级地位虽然略高于大将军，但是在控制军事实权和亲近皇帝的程度上，却比不上后者。明帝是要为曹氏亲族的年轻将领腾出这一重要位置，与异姓元勋重臣进行力量平衡，从而保证皇权安定稳固。戊子：旧历初八日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":297,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ddf87e6819a0a2dfe019","start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o043","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-9b32a12fd737552ea52d","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，戊子〖1〗，以大将军司马宣王为太尉。己亥〖2〗。复置朔方郡。京都大疫。丁巳〖3〗，皇太后崩。乙亥〖4〗，陨石于寿光县〖5〗。三月，庚寅〖6〗，葬文德郭后。营陵于首阳陵涧西〖7〗，如终制。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-69d95c2d10b2c4a40b0c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年，立为齐王。景初三年正月，丁亥朔，帝病甚，乃立为皇太子。是日，即皇帝位。大赦。尊皇后曰皇太后〖2〗。大将军曹爽、太尉司马宣王辅政。诏曰：“朕以眇身〖3〗，继承鸿业。茕茕在疚〖4〗，靡所控告〖5〗。大将军、太尉奉受末命〖6〗，夹辅朕躬；司徒、司空，冢宰元辅总率百僚〖7〗，以宁社稷；其与群卿大夫勉勖乃心〖8〗，称朕意焉。”诸所兴作宫室之役，皆以遗诏罢之；官奴婢六十以上，免为良人〖9〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
